{#
  BeMart favorites list — EC-CUBE goFavoriteList.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Mypage/favorite.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Mypage/favorite.twig).

  Markup skeleton, `ec-mypageRole` / `ec-favoriteRole` /
  `ec-favoriteRole__itemList` / `ec-favoriteRole__item` classes and the
  block structure are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE. Only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound to the FavoriteList resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Mypage/FavoriteList.php):
    customerId, favorites[] { productCode, productName, unitPrice,
                              fileName },
    favoriteCount

  Mypage/navi.twig -> the shared partial `Page/Mypage/navi.html.twig`.

  Per the Phase 3 ALPS audit, `Favorite` was re-tagged `src-template`:
  the favorite row composes productName / unitPrice, and FavoriteEntity
  / SqlFavoriteStorage carry these, so the resource body is sufficient
  for the row content.

  Phase 3 ENRICHMENT — the `Favorite` ALPS descriptor + FavoriteEntity
  were widened with `fileName` (the product main-image file name — the
  lowest-`sort_no` `dtb_product_image` row). SqlFavoriteStorage JOINs
  the image table; FakeFavoriteStorage carries the parallel field. The
  favorite-row THUMBNAIL is now wired (previously a missing-body-field
  residual), falling back to the shared `no_image_product` placeholder
  when the product has no image — the same CartItem `mainImage` pattern.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}` -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `pagination` -> the resource body's flat `favorites` list; BeMart's
     FavoriteList is not a paged view, so the `ec-pagerRole` +
     `pager.twig` include is OMITTED.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` — BeMart renders the token into the
     `token-for-anchor` attribute expected by EC-CUBE's `function.js`;
     the router normalizes the generated `_token` field to `csrfToken`.
   - MISSING BODY FIELD — EC-CUBE's favorite.twig renders a price RANGE
     (`price02_inc_tax_min`～`price02_inc_tax_max`). BeMart's
     FavoriteEntity carries a single `unitPrice`, so the min/max range
     is OMITTED; the row shows the single price. Enumerated as residual.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'mypage' %}
{% set route = 'mypage-favorite-list' %}
{% set title = 'マイページ' %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-layoutRole__main">
        <div class="ec-mypageRole">
            <div class="ec-pageHeader">
                <h1>マイページ/お気に入り一覧</h1>
            </div>
            {% include 'Page/Mypage/navi.html.twig' with { mypageno: 'favorite', name01: name01|default(''), name02: name02|default('') } %}
        </div>

        <div class="ec-mypageRole">
            <div class="ec-favoriteRole">
                {% if favoriteCount > 0 %}
                    <div class="ec-favoriteRole__header">
                        <p>{{ favoriteCount }}件のお気に入りがあります</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ec-favoriteRole__detail">
                        <ul class="ec-favoriteRole__itemList">
                            {% for FavoriteProduct in favorites %}
                                <li class="ec-favoriteRole__item">
                                    <a class="ec-closeBtn--circle"
                                       href="/mypage/favorite?productCode={{ FavoriteProduct.productCode }}&_method=delete"
                                       token-for-anchor="{{ csrf_token_for_anchor() }}"
                                       data-method="delete">
                                        <div class="ec-icon">
                                            <img src="{{ asset('assets/icon/cross-white.svg') }}" alt="close">
                                        </div>
                                    </a>
                                    <a class="ec-favoriteRole__itemThumb" href="/product?productCode={{ FavoriteProduct.productCode }}">
                                        <p class="ec-favoriteRole__item-image">
                                            <img src="{{ asset(FavoriteProduct.fileName|default('assets/img/common/no_image_product.png'), 'save_image') }}">
                                        </p>
                                    </a>
                                    <p class="ec-favoriteRole__itemTitle">{{ FavoriteProduct.productName }}</p>
                                    <p class="ec-favoriteRole__itemPrice">
                                        {{ FavoriteProduct.unitPrice|price }}
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="ec-favoriteRole__header">お気に入りは登録されていません。</div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
